Catalytic Cracking of Methyl Ester Derived from Used Cooking Oil
        Over Ni-Impregnated Activated Charcoal Catalyst

        N. Nazarudin1,2,3,4*), Y.Y. Hans2,3), O. Alfernando2,3,4), U. Ulyarti3,4,5), I.B Adilina6
 1
     Department of Chemistry Education, Faculty of Faculty of Teacher Training and Education (FKIP), Universitas
                                                 Jambi, Jambi, Indonesia
           2
            Department of Chemical Engineering, Engineering Faculty, Universitas Jambi, Jambi, Indonesia
                    3
                      Energy and Nano Material Centre, LPPM, Universitas Jambi, Jambi, Indonesia.
