     Dual metal NiMo dispersed on silica derived from rice husk ash as a
    catalyst for hydrocracking of used palm cooking oil into liquid biofuels
Karna Wijayaa, Risandrika Dwijayanti Putri Setyonoa, Remi Ayu Pratikab, Eddy Heraldyc, Ahmad
