Removal of Phenol from Wastewater by Supported Liquid Membrane
Process
Norasikin Othmana,b*, Ling Chui Henga, Norul Fatiha Mohamed Noaha, Ooi Zing Yia, Norela Jusoha, Nur Alina Nasruddina, Nora’aini Alib,
Sofiah Hamzahb
